<p>This SCP is based on a real-world paranormal phenomenon known as the Gurdon Lights, that I coincidentally live near to. Thanks to DrChandra and Monorail for the crits. Images were created by myself using both self-made and Creative Commons assets.</p>
<p>More info about the real-world lights can be found here-</p>
<p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gurdon_Light">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gurdon_Light</a></p>
<p><a href="http://www.encyclopediaofarkansas.net/encyclopedia/entry-detail.aspx?entryID=1198">http://www.encyclopediaofarkansas.net/encyclopedia/entry-detail.aspx?entryID=1198</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.arkansas.com/things-to-do/uniquely-arkansas/haunted-arkansas/mysterious-lights/">https://www.arkansas.com/things-to-do/uniquely-arkansas/haunted-arkansas/mysterious-lights/</a></p>
<p>Enjoy!</p>
<p>EDIT: Changed the non-collapsable image into a collapsible with the help of Phi Fehu, <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/mortos-collapsible">http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/mortos-collapsible</a> and SCP-2999. Thanks to everyone who did stuff to help make my stuff into better stuff.</p>

